    "body": "OK I just pushed a change here that’s essentially a completely new implementation, using a self-hosted instance of an open-source decentralized search engine (Yacy) to power the search feature.\r\n\r\nYou can try it out at https://sideshowbarker.net/html-multipage-search/",
