    "body": "Oooh, now that's looking interesting. The UX has me a bit confused (is there a way to actually jump to the result?), and the results seem a bit strange sometimes (I get lots of irrelevant results for \"context menu\"; no results for \"link\"; and the \"a\" in \"a element\" appears to be ignored). And I think the old code is still there as pressing enter pops up the overlay with a Google search. But I'm excited about the general direction...",
